    "description": {
      "en": "<p>the first international contemporary art fair dedicated to ceramics</p>",
      "fr": "<p>la première foire internationale d'art contemporain dédiée à la céramique</p>",
      "nl": "<p>the first international contemporary art fair dedicated to ceramics</p>"
