        "position": 1,
        "type": "image-text",
        "text": {
          "nl": "<p>is eregast van de vierde editie van ceramic brussels.</p><p>→ <a target=\"\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://ceramic.brussels/nl/invitee-d-honneur\">ontdek de kunstenaar hier</a></p>",
          "en": "<p>is the guest of honour of the fourth edition of ceramic brussels.</p><p>→ <a target=\"\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://ceramic.brussels/en/invitee-d-honneur\">discover the artist here</a></p>",
          "fr": "<p>est l'invitée d'honneur de la quatrième édition de ceramic brussels.</p><p>→ <a target=\"\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://ceramic.brussels/fr/invitee-d-honneur\">découvrez l'artiste ici</a></p>"
        },
