        "title": {
          "en": "gallery applications are open",
          "fr": "ouverture des candidatures galeries",
          "nl": "de galerie inschrijving is geopend"
        },
        "text": {
          "en": "<p>Applications are now open for the 4th edition of ceramic brussels (January 20–24, 2027).</p><p>→ <a target=\"\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://ceramic.brussels/en/gallery-applications-2\">application information</a></p>",
          "fr": "<p>Les candidatures pour la 4e édition de ceramic brussels (20 au 24 janvier 2027) sont désormais ouvertes.</p><p>→ <a target=\"\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://ceramic.brussels/fr/gallery-applications-2\">plus d'informations</a></p>",
          "nl": "<p>De inschrijving voor de 4e editie van ceramic brussels (20-24 januari 2027) is nu geopend.</p><p>→ <a target=\"\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://ceramic.brussels/nl/gallery-applications-2\">meer informatie</a></p>"
        },
