        "title": {
          "en": "jury prize 2026",
          "fr": "jury prize 2026",
          "nl": "jury prize 2026"
        },
        "text": {
          "en": "<p>Marie Pic won the ceramic jury prize 2026.<br>Additional awards, granted by our institutional partners, have also been presented to the laureates.</p><p>→<u> </u><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://ceramic.brussels/en/art-prize#awards-2\"><u>discover all the awards here</u></a></p>",
          "fr": "<p>Marie Pic a remporté le ceramic jury prize 2026.</p><p>Des prix complémentaires, attribués par nos partenaires institutionnels, ont également été décernés aux lauréat·es.</p><p>→<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://ceramic.brussels/fr/art-prize#awards-2\"><u>découvrez l’ensemble des awards ici</u></a></p>",
          "nl": "<p>Marie Pic heeft de ceramic jury prize 2026 gewonnen<strong>.</strong><br>Daarnaast werden ook aanvullende prijzen, toegekend door onze institutionele partners, uitgereikt aan de laureaten.</p><p>→ <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://ceramic.brussels/nl/art-prize#awards-2\"><u>ontdek hier alle awards</u></a></p>"
        },
