          "nl": "Blader door de exposanten 2026"
        },
        "text": {
          "en": "<p>Over 70 Belgian and international exhibitors, a focus on Spain, and the presentation of around 200 artists. <br><br>→ <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://ceramic.brussels/en/exhibitors\"><u>browse the exhibitors</u></a></p>",
          "fr": "<p>Plus de&nbsp;70 exposant·es belges et international·es, un&nbsp;focus sur l’Espagne&nbsp;et la présentation de&nbsp;près de 200 artistes.&nbsp;<br><br>→ <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://ceramic.brussels/fr/exhibitors\"><u>parcourez les exposant·es</u></a></p>",
          "nl": "<p>70 Belgische en internationale exposanten, een focus op Spanje, en de presentatie van meer dan 200 kunstenaars. </p><p>→ <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://ceramic.brussels/nl/exhibitors\"><u>blader door de exposanten</u></a></p>"
