        "contact_text": {
          "en": "<p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"mailto:info@ceramic.brussels\"><u>info@ceramic.brussels</u></a></p><p></p><p><strong>↘ the team</strong></p><p><strong>co-directors</strong></p><p>Jean-Marc Dimanche &amp; Gilles Parmentier </p><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"mailto:jean-marc@ceramic.brussels\"><u>jean-marc@ceramic.brussels</u></a><br><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"mailto:gilles@ceramic.brussels\"><u>gilles@ceramic.brussels</u></a></p><p><strong>exhibitors relations &amp; fair coordination&nbsp;</strong></p><p>Tiphaine Quéguineur </p><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"mailto:tipahine@ceramic.brussels\"><u>tiphaine@ceramic.brussels</u></a></p><p><strong>communication &amp; partners relations</strong></p><p>Julie Alluin </p><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"mailto:julie@ceramic.brussels\"><u>julie@ceramic.brussels</u></a></p><p></p><p><strong>↘ follow us!</strong></p><p><a target=\"\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/ceramic.brussels/\">instagram</a><br><a target=\"\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=100094708248221\">facebook</a></p><p><strong>↘ </strong><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://mailchi.mp/ceramic/ceramic-brussels\"><u><strong>subscribe to our newsletter</strong></u></a></p>",
          "fr": "<p></p><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"mailto:info@ceramic.brussels\"><u>info@ceramic.brussels</u></a></p><p>↓</p><p><strong>co-directeurs</strong></p><p>Jean-Marc Dimanche <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"mailto:jean-marc@ceramic.brussels\"><u>jean-marc@ceramic.brussels</u></a><br>&amp; Gilles Parmentier <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"mailto:gilles@ceramic.brussels\"><u>gilles@ceramic.brussels</u></a></p><p><strong>relations avec les exposants et coordination de la foire</strong></p><p>Tiphaine Quéguineur <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"mailto:tipahine@ceramic.brussels\"><u>tiphaine@ceramic.brussels</u></a></p><p><strong>communication et relations avec les partenaires</strong></p><p>Julie Alluin <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"mailto:julie@ceramic.brussels\"><u>julie@ceramic.brussels</u></a></p><p></p><p><strong>↘ suivez-nous!</strong><br>sur instagram → <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/ceramic.brussels/\">@</a><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http://ceramic.brussels\">ceramic.brussels</a><br>sur facebook → <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=100094708248221\">ceramic brussels</a></p><p>pour recevoir la newsletter ceramic brussels<br><strong>↘ </strong><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://mailchi.mp/ceramic/ceramic-brussels\"><u><strong>abonnez-vous</strong></u></a></p>",
          "nl": "<p></p><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"mailto:info@ceramic.brussels\"><u>info@ceramic.brussels</u></a></p><p>↓</p><p><strong>co-directors</strong></p><p>Jean-Marc Dimanche <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"mailto:jean-marc@ceramic.brussels\"><u>jean-marc@ceramic.brussels</u></a><br>&amp; Gilles Parmentier <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"mailto:gilles@ceramic.brussels\"><u>gilles@ceramic.brussels</u></a></p><p><strong>relaties met exposanten &amp; coördinatie van de beurs</strong></p><p>Tiphaine Quéguineur <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"mailto:tipahine@ceramic.brussels\"><u>tiphaine@ceramic.brussels</u></a></p><p><strong>communicatie &amp; partnerrelaties</strong></p><p>Julie Alluin <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"mailto:julie@ceramic.brussels\"><u>julie@ceramic.brussels</u></a></p><p></p><p></p><p><strong>↘ volg ons!</strong><br>op instagram → <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/ceramic.brussels/\">@</a><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http://ceramic.brussels\">ceramic.brussels</a><br>op facebook → <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=100094708248221\">ceramic brussels</a></p><p>om de nieuwsbrief ceramic brussels ontvangen<br><strong>↘ </strong><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://mailchi.mp/ceramic/ceramic-brussels\"><u><strong>aanmelden</strong></u></a></p>"
